OL,3,AFamily of killed teen call for death
OL,4,Apenalty in D4vd trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of 14-year-old Celeste Rivas
OL,7,FHernandez has lobbied for the death
OL,8,Fpenalty if D4vd is found guilty
OL,9,Fmurdering their daughter.
OL,11,FD4vd, who was born David Anthony Burke,
OL,12,Fis charged with killing the teenager,
OL,13,Fwhose dismembered body was found in the
OL,14,Ftrunk of a Tesla car registered to his
OL,15,Faddress on 8 September 2025. Burke has
OL,16,Fpleaded not guilty to the charges.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
