OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFamily of killed teen call for death
OL,4,Apenalty in D4vd trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death penalty is under a temporary
OL,7,Fban in California, where Burke is due
OL,8,Fto stand trial, but in a statement
OL,9,FHernandez' family said execution "would
OL,10,Fbe perfect" if the singer was convicted
OL,11,Fof murder.
OL,13,FIn a related development, Hernandez's
OL,14,Fparents filed a civil lawsuit against
OL,15,FBurke on Friday, seeking monetary
OL,16,Fdamages including burial and funeral
OL,17,Fexpenses.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
